### LaTeX Document Compilation

Theory documents and presentation decks are individual self-contained LaTeX
projects built via `latexmk`:

```bash
# Build a docs/theory/ document
cd docs/theory/<content-slug> && latexmk -pdf main.tex

# Build a docs/report/ document or slide deck
cd docs/report/<content-slug> && latexmk -pdf main.tex
```
